# Batch files are run by cmd.exe, which wants CRLF, and they are only
# ever used on Windows. Everything else keeps LF whatever the checkout.
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# The H.264 test vectors and the pictures a reference decoder made from
# them. A newline translated anywhere in either is a decoder bug that
# only appears on one platform, so neither is ever text.
*.264 binary
*.i420.z binary
*.mp4 binary
